            "text": "Missing authentication on custom route (BFLA/API5) — Requires further review: GET /api/video-poster\n\nRoute has NO `info.auth` check (unlike its siblings), confirmed live: unauthenticated GET returns 200 image/jpeg 54KB poster for posts record mz33mve1ouwipbv. BUT the underlying /api/files/posts/... file itself also returned 200 unauthenticated (73MB), so the poster route is not clearly the causal control. Needs confirmation whether anonymous file access is deployment-wide by design (broader finding) or whether video-poster exceeds the /api/files policy."
