          "message": {
            "text": "JWT forgery / algorithm confusion / claim tampering — Ruled out: PocketBase HS256 auth JWT (Authorization header)\n\nFired forged/alg-confusion tokens at /api/collections/users/auth-refresh: alg=none/None/NONE with empty signature, tampered payload (role=moderator, id=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaa, exp=past, exp=9999999999, exp removed, collectionId=_pb_superusers_auth_), and HS256 signed with guessed keys (empty, secret, password, pocketbase, changeme, test). ALL returned 401 \"The request requires valid record authorization token.\"; baseline real token returned 200. PocketBase verifies HMAC over the exact header.payload bytes and independently validates exp/collectionId. Recorded rejection exact."
