              "risk_area": "JSON/prototype pollution in participants handling; achievement progress forgery",
              "surface": "achievementslib.parseParticipants + countUserTournamentPlacesFromPosts",
              "recorded_by": "SSTI/RCE & Injection Hunter",
              "source": "agent_reported"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/ssrf-path-traversal-crlf-header-injection",
          "ruleIndex": 35,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "SSRF / path traversal / CRLF header injection — No issue identified: /api/yadisk-preview and /api/yadisk-content (yadisklib.js)\n\nSSRF: /api/yadisk-preview enforces auth (401 anonymous) and an allowlist regex ^https?://(disk.yandex.(ru|com(.tr)?)|yadi.sk)/(i|d|a|public)/ — tested http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/health, https://example.com, https://disk.yandex.ru@127.0.0.1/i/x (userinfo confusion) and HTTP://DISK.YANDEX.RU/i/x; all non-Yandex forms returned 400 'Некорректная ссылка Яндекс.Диска' and only the canonical host was forwarded. /api/yadisk-content additionally returns 401 anonymously. Path traversal (path=../../../../etc/passwd) returned 404 and the value is only used as an encodeURIComponent'd query parameter to the Yandex public-resources API, not as a filesystem path. Header injection: CRLF payloads (%0d%0aX-Injected: ...) in both `url` and `path` produced no injected response header and no response splitting."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "/api/yadisk-preview and /api/yadisk-content (yadisklib.js)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
