              "risk_area": "PocketBase filter injection via string concatenation",
              "surface": "pb_hooks filter construction (all findRecordsByFilter call sites)",
              "recorded_by": "SSTI/RCE & Injection Hunter",
              "source": "agent_reported"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/mass-assignment-privilege-escalation-rating-points-attendance-count-role-membership-sessions",
          "ruleIndex": 37,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Mass assignment / privilege escalation (rating_points, attendance_count, role, membership, sessions) — Ruled out: PATCH /api/collections/users/records/{self} — privileged user fields\n\nBlocked by the field allow-list in pb_hooks/users_access_guard_lib.js:119-153 (SELF_EDITABLE_ALWAYS at lines 6-16) invoked from pb_hooks/users_access_guard.pb.js:15-33 on every non-privileged update. Live 403 for rating_points, attendance_count, role, is_visible-free membership fields: {\"message\":\"Изменение поля \\\"rating_points\\\" недоступно.\"}. The guard compares original vs record with NUMBER_FIELDS/BOOL_FIELDS-aware comparison (lines 81-97), so arithmetic operators (`rating_points+`) and type coercion do not evade it."
          },
          "locations": [
