        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/secrets-sensitive-data-exposure-in-deployed-client-bundles-and-source-maps",
          "ruleIndex": 47,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Secrets/sensitive data exposure in deployed client bundles and source maps — No issue identified: https://app.milenkih-team.ru/assets/*.js and *.js.map\n\nFetched and grepped the live bundles (`/assets/index-sW5gRO0J.js`, vendor-*.js) for bot_token|BOT_TOKEN|api_key|API_KEY|secret|password|Bearer|sk-|ghp_ and internal hosts/IPs. Only hits were the literal string `password` inside a client-side form-field strip list and a `BOT_BLOCKED` error constant. Only public URLs found (app origin, `/api/max-auth`, a public max.ru profile link). `/assets/index-sW5gRO0J.js.map` and `/assets/vendor-misc-0aLwSU7b.js.map` both return 404 — no source maps deployed. No secrets or restricted source disclosed."
          },
