        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/broken-function-level-authorization-superuser-admin-surfaces",
          "ruleIndex": 58,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Broken function-level authorization (superuser/admin surfaces) — Ruled out: PocketBase admin/superuser surfaces (/api/collections/_superusers/*, /api/backups, /api/logs, /api/settings, /_/)\n\nGET /api/collections/_superusers/records -> 403 `{\"message\":\"Only superusers can perform this action.\"}` for both anonymous and user tokens. GET /api/backups and GET /api/logs -> 401 anon / 403 user (superuser-only, PocketBase 0.23 gates these). GET /_/ -> nginx 401 with Basic-auth challenge (nginx/1.24.0). GET /api/settings -> 401 anon / 403 user. /api/collections/users/records/{id}/impersonate -> 404 (endpoint does not exist in this version). /api/collections/users/records/{id}/external-auths -> 404. No superuser material was reachable with a user token."
          },
